{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1478240-sorcerer-s-mana-and-tass","id":1478240,"title":"Sorcerer's Mana and Tass","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-07T15:10:00-07:00","id":1478240,"title":"Sorcerer's Mana and Tass","content":"I'm new here, and fairly new to the World of Darkness collection of games. Be gentle!<br /> <br /> I have so many questions. I honestly find the system(s) to have a steep learning curve. So I'm reading a lot on these forums and the books.<br /> <br /> My question for today - Can my Sorcerer transmute, or in some fashion, create Tass from his Mana? I'd really like to get a Familiar, but am struggling with how to feed it.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27372-sleepr","name":"sleepr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-07T19:19:42-07:00","id":1478249,"title":"","content":"Sorcerers, made with the Revised rules, have a different background instead of Familiar for such entities that's built to their abilities.<br /> <br /> Familiars don't normally have to be fed in Tass though; that's a quirk some Familiar have though. Sorcerers can convert Mana to Tass via the Mana Manipulation Path.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-11T18:25:27-07:00","id":1478629,"title":"","content":"As Heavy Arms stated, you can create Mana from Tass using the Mana Manipulation path; I think 3 dots would be enough to do that. As for feeding your Familiar or Guide/Lesser Familiar as they are called for sorcerers, that depends on what you and your ST believes is appropriate. Your Guide could ask for mana in exchange for knowledge or access to its powers or it could ask for something else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24121-starcomet","name":"Starcomet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24121_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}